      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "At 5,994 feet, Valle sits at the junction of US 180 and State Route 64, roughly halfway to the Grand Canyon.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
        9,
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Valle%2C_Arizona",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Valle hosts a Planes of Fame Air Museum that rotates WWI and WWII aircraft, including a Douglas AD‑4N Skyraider.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17,
        19,
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.arizonahandbook.com/valle.htm",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Flintstones Bedrock City recreates a life‑size town with Fred and Barney’s houses, a volcano ride, and a cartoon theater.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23,
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
