      ],
      "source": "https://www.arizonahandbook.com/valle.htm",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "In 1935, the Grand Canyon Sheep Company merged with VVV Livestock to form the Arizona Livestock Company, which ran Valle Ranch west of the junction.",
